{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_02_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_02","title":"歌手","storyCode":"SV-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"55058dacf62ace71596a0d7418912edc4571e2db2c37bfc98fd12f19df0d8584","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯卡蒂輕鬆收拾了對她抱有敵意的居民，遇到一名願意與她交流的女孩安妮塔。安妮塔為她指路，幫助她找尋幽靈鯊的下落。同時，還有另一雙眼睛始終盯著斯卡蒂。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......你、你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？還有一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別動手......我和他們不大一樣。我知道你是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能明白我的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是跟著長凳來這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，嗚嗚......木框，木框......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他跑，我跟著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我們沒有惡意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他把我的東西還給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"長、長凳......你拿了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"亮亮......亮亮......硬......痛痛......嗚嗚嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這個不能吃呀！快，快從嘴裡拿出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，長凳看到沒見過的東西就想用手拿。他不懂這東西他不該拿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（接過項鍊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，全是口水......你的手都弄髒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿回來就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不常見陌生面孔。你是從外面來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從其他伊比利亞城市來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少見到別的地方來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你這身衣服......也很奇怪。我從沒見過這種料子。外面的人都穿成這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪歌手才這麼穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪......歌手？我聽到你對鐵皮他們說了，但我不知道那是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我這樣到處走，偶爾停下來，彈彈琴，唱唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這箱子裡呢，裝的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩克斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"薩克斯是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樂器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的是個流浪歌手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲嘀咕）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是來做什麼的呢？唱歌嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來找人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人是誰？也是一位流浪歌手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。她是我的夥伴，我們是同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她也來了鹽風城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。你見過她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒說她長什麼樣子呢......算啦！我剛才也說過了，像你這樣的人，我以前從來沒見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去問其他人。你能帶路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"帶路？那個陷阱......是我做的。我以為你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你不怪我？我還以為你至少會......也教訓我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。我趕時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼突然停下來......撞在箱子上了，痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了說。我箱子裡面的東西，對你沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了這個，你想要什麼，幫我找到人，我都可以給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我只是好奇......有那麼明顯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你做的陷阱一樣顯而易見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......歌手，你不光有一雙靈巧的手，你還有一雙厲害的眼睛啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"九十八......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"九十九......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這裡，怎麼問問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？你在外面一般怎麼問？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（砰一聲放下背上箱子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用這個問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？薩......薩克斯？你用樂器問問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砰砰，咚，啪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個樂器的聲音還挺奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有效率。一般他們都會馬上開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不說的話，可以換個角度，再來一輪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那我懷疑在這裡行不通哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸箱子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，剛才那兩個，已經開口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮嗎？他們應該都不知道樂器。這裡的人，通常只做自己的事，不怎麼搭理人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他們，呃，很少說話。就算知道，他們也不懂怎麼回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你理我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能因為我這人有點怪，我和大家都不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話說得也比他們好很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？我好高興。這都是佩特拉奶奶教我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你想找人再問問的話，我可以帶你去找佩特拉奶奶。她是我們這裡年紀最大的人，知道的事情也最多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，歌手，走這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"九十九、九十九......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"九十九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說他們？不用管他們，他們只是站著。路是擠了一點，但你不小心碰到他們也沒事，他們不會有什麼反應，是吧，桌腳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？跳起來——從頭頂過去了？這、這是怎麼做到的？完全沒碰到底下的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的人都是這麼走路的嗎？真神奇啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"到啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶！佩——特——拉奶奶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"別叫喚這麼大聲，你是想把我的耳朵震壞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，奶奶，您今天看起來真有精神呀！您還是在——呃，曬太陽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"太陽......呵，哪裡來的太陽。我等了這麼多年，都再也沒瞧見太陽。安妮塔，你又在做什麼？你總是跑來跑去的，像有什麼了不起的事一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"......在這裡，還能有什麼要緊事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶，我沒什麼事，是有別人要找您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"——咦，人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼一眨眼就跑這裡來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？哪裡呀？我怎麼沒瞧見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人藏得很好。只是，還不夠好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼這麼嚴肅？你不是個流浪歌手嗎？要表演的話，應該很習慣被別人盯著看吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們過去吧！佩特拉奶奶精神不錯，說不定你真能問到些什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"天上的紅霞，映著我火紅的衣裳......心愛的人啊，帶我飛過藍色的海洋......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶，您又在做什麼呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮塔，噢，討厭的安妮塔！沒看見我在跳舞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"一個女孩子在跳舞的時候，沒有人能打擾她。你要一起來嗎，安妮塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"您慢點轉，待會可別又頭暈啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"胡說！我怎麼會頭暈？我能一口氣轉上十來圈，全城的人都會為我鼓掌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"您歇一會，看看我們這位流浪歌手吧。她有問題要問您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪歌手？我幾十年沒見過什麼流浪歌手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"這日光......這日光也太長了。夜晚怎麼還不到。等天黑了，酒吧裡就會有人彈琴......你是不是也會去彈琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在廣場上跳舞，對，就在這裡......噢，我可以連著轉無數個圈。我有一條紅色的裙子，姑娘，我得說，比你身上的這條漂亮多啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"好多小夥子都想和我一起跳。在他們當中，我最喜歡曼紐爾，他年輕時候最英俊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，佩特拉奶奶，您和我說過這些，說過好幾遍啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"再說說看，誰要找我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊，你這條紅色的裙子，可真漂亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"紅色的......不，我不要......我不要紅色的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"海水！海水是活的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，又開始了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"......突然就湧了上來。都死了！好好的......好好的那麼多人。活下來的人也沒有吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"曼紐爾......曼紐爾他本來說要帶我走。後來他反悔啦。他說那些出去的人都沒回來，他們都死在了外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這一段您也說過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"再後來他說要保護我。他答應我的——他說要保護我！可是他只是想騙我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"他要把我藏起來的吃的都騙走——咳咳，我假裝答應了他，撿起了我母親留下的銀花瓶——咳咳咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"紅色的......我喜歡紅色的......不，我不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶，佩特拉奶奶！您別說這些了，只要一說這些，您就會喘不過氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我帶人來找您，是想問別的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"問問題？誰要問問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是她，一位外面來的流浪歌手。"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你要找什麼人，快點問呀！趁佩特拉奶奶現在還有力氣回答你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪歌手。我想找一個人，她和我一樣，也是從外面來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的——外面的人！你胡說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"根本沒有什麼外面的人會來這裡，他們早就不管我們了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"你是來搶我東西的對不對？你要搶走我的食物，搶走我的衣服，你要吃我的肉、喝我的血——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！你這個怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（皺眉）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，這裡沒有怪物。她只是個流浪歌手呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"紅色的裙擺......紅色的......我找到了，在這裡......歌聲響起來了......曼紐爾在等我，我要走啦，該走啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老年居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"......心愛的人啊，映著我火紅的衣裳......火紅的衣裳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，今天佩特拉奶奶格外激動，我或許不該帶你來見她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我先扶她進屋，歌手，你等我一會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你還在找那個在看你的人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒露面的麻煩，就像不敢露出牙齒的小獸。不用管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道彈琴，還知道跳舞。她說起話來就像外面的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣嗎？難怪，她說的很多東西，我都聽不懂哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫我怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是故意的。奶奶她經常看到不存在的東西，就像老在做夢一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......誰不是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她病了，沒法回答你問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你不要著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我住的地方還有其他兄弟。我待會再帶你去問問他們。就是不知道他們願不願意開口。有時候真的很難和他們對話哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，兄弟。你也是伊比利亞人，你們不這麼叫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我的媽媽並沒有其他孩子，不過，我有很多兄弟姐妹。城裡的大家，我們都是兄弟姐妹。這是律法說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還信這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不然哩？在我小時候，還有佩特拉奶奶嘴裡的、過去那段黑暗的日子，我們曾經犯過錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候大家都只顧著自己，躲在各自家裡，從來不說話。有時候挖出一個罐頭，我們還會，呃，打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"後來情況慢慢變好了。我們現在會住在一起，偶爾說話。大家開始，呃，學會分享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"——“我們想活下去，所以我們更加愛彼此。因為愛，我們緊密相連。不能搶劫，不能爭鬥。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"“要使得自身強健，更要令族群更強健，這樣才能有更好的生活。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話聽著耳熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？教士說，外面的大家也都信這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了說，這些都是教士教給我們的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"每次他都會講好多......我大部分聽不大懂，除了上面那句話，就只記得要把大家都當成兄弟，要對大家都好一點。反正都是好話吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀。他和你一樣，也是從外面來的。不過這是很多年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"就是他來了以後，我們才變好了。他是我們中的一個兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"大多數時候是一個人。哦，聽鐵皮他們說，後來還有另一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒見過呀。她不怎麼露面的。有時候教士和我們說話，那個人會站在他背後。我只遠遠地瞧過那麼一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼......你這急急忙忙的，是要往哪裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道怎麼去教堂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的教堂，沒那麼難認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"路不算好走哩。要從這裡一直走去海邊。來，我指給你看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼停下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然跟過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？我又聽不懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只黏人的小獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪啊，你總說小獸，那應該是指動物吧？我們這裡沒有活著的動物，早就沒有啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，繼續走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，外面來的朋友，你說了算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了嗎？就在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我們一般不會在這個時候去教堂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有辦法進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以進去，我們都可以。教堂的大門始終都為篤信之人打開，那個教士是這麼說的。可是......你是想去找人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"他這時候一般不在教堂裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他什麼時候在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"每隔一段時間，他會主動出現在我們面前，親切地與我們每個人聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼問題的話，你也可以在那個時候去找他。無論你有什麼問題，他都不會拒絕你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"在那一天之內，到第二天太陽升起來之前，他都會待在教堂裡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦，他還可以幫你找人！那位教士的話，知道的肯定比我們多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一段時間是多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，最近挺久沒見到他了。我不像他們，不怎麼數日子。可應該就這兩天吧？大家的食物都快吃光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，當你說好的時候，我老覺得你不像是真心答應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這不對，教士說了，我們不該懷疑他人。哎，他們都說我總是愛想各種問題，這樣對好的生活並沒有幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是他說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，他可不會對我說這個，我早溜走哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是鐵皮他們，大家都嫌我吵鬧。又不是我總想說這麼多話的。我們這裡的人，他們都太安靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"當所有人都不說話的時候，我太無聊，就只好一個人說個不停了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"以前只有佩特拉奶奶總是陪我說話。現在還有你了，真好。哎呀，你會不會也嫌我煩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我來的地方，比你更愛說個不停的人有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說的話，那一定是個好地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是還行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"在你來的地方，人們會跳舞嗎？就像佩特拉奶奶說的那樣，廣場上的舞會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼不見你跳舞呢？我看到你的琴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶和我說過。你們不是會邊唱邊跳嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的舞蹈......你們不能看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間，場合，面前的人，都不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你太奇怪了，簡直比我還要奇怪。你的家到底是哪裡？你來的地方，那裡的人都像你這麼奇怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撥琴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來的地方，並不是家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道我家是哪裡了。我家已經沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那也沒什麼。我家也早就沒了，好幾年前一場大風，房子塌啦。我媽媽當時就在房間裡，她人也沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這也沒什麼。大家都這樣。房子沒了的話，再找一間沒人的就可以住下。這裡房子有的是哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你不高興跳舞的話，你會唱歌給我聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒聽過別人唱歌呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"太好啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，走了這麼多地方，我肚子都餓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你也一定餓了吧？餓著肚子的話，是不是也唱不動歌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去找吃的去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是我跑得太快了嗎？我忘了你還不認識路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我叫安妮塔！你以後可以喊我名字，這樣你就不會跟不上我了。你叫我一聲，我就會停下來等你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
